        "value": {
          "en": "<p>The public car park at the Hong Kong Heritage Museum has been closed from 1 August 2025 onward to facilitate the Trunk Road T4 construction project, and the site has been handed over to the Civil Engineering and Development Department for related works.<br /><br />We apologize for any inconvenience this may cause.</p>",
          "tc": "<p>為配合T4號主幹路建造工程，香港文化博物館公眾停車場已由2025年8月1日起停止運作，並已移交土木工程拓展署進行相關工程。<br /><br />不便之處，敬請原諒。</p>",
          "sc": "<p>为配合T4号主干路建造工程，香港文化博物馆公众停车场已由2025年8月1日起停止运作，并已移交土木工程拓展署进行相关工程。<br /><br />不便之处，敬请原谅。</p>"
